SUMMARY:Beginning Drawing: Virtual
DESCRIPTION:with Kathy Schermer-Gramm\, Professional Artist \nDates: Saturdays\, August 1\, 8\, 15 and 22 (4-sessions)\nTime: 1:15 p.m. – 4:45 p.m. ET\nLocation: Online class via Zoom\nFee: $210 ($189 Members) \nAn introductory level course of drawing for beginners and those wishing to refresh their skills. Includes using a sketchbook for line drawing exercises on seeing to draw\, quick sketching\, mapping for accuracy\, and other basic principles of drawing. \nThis is a live Zoom format class divided into a group session for lecture\, demonstrations\, and group critique with the instructor followed by one-on-one individual appointments for consultation and problem solving. \nCore course for the Certificate in Botanical Art & Illustration. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncbg.unc.edu/event/beginning-drawing-virtual-4-session-course/
LOCATION:NC
CATEGORIES:Learn
END:VEVENT
