SUMMARY:Fall Leaves in Watercolor: Virtual
DESCRIPTION:with Lisa Rasmussen\, Professional Artist \nDates: Thursdays\, October 1\, 8\, 15\, and 22 (4-sessions)\nTime: 9:15 a.m. – 12:45 p.m. ET\nLocation: Online via Zoom\nFee: $210 ($189 Members) \nExperience Level: Open to all\, from beginners to experienced learners \nIn this four-session class\, we’ll explore painting in watercolor using leaves of plants and trees native to the southeastern U.S. as our subjects. Join us in creating paintings that highlight the changing colors of the season! \nElective course for the Certificate in Botanical Art & Illustration. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncbg.unc.edu/event/fall-leaves-in-watercolor-virtual-4-sessions/
LOCATION:NC
END:VEVENT
